    "what_this_does_not_test": "Both runs used the same checkout, the same environment_files and any learned verifier checkpoints already on disk. It is a same-machine repeatability check, not an independent reproduction.",
    "what_this_tests": "Two independent full runs of capture.py, each re-solving every game through solve_adaptered and re-cutting its window. Identical detected bands mean the route, the window and the detector are all reproducible -- the thing a third party needs in order to re-derive these masks rather than take them on trust.",
